  "transcript": [
    {
      "turn": 0,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "Hi doctor. I've been getting headaches."
    },
    {
      "turn": 1,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Can you tell me more about the headaches — like how often they happen, how long they last, and what they feel like?"
    },
    {
      "turn": 1,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "They happen four or five days a week. Last most of the afternoon. Feel like a tight band squeezing around the head. Not throbbing."
    },
    {
      "turn": 2,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Do you have any other symptoms along with the headaches, like nausea, sensitivity to light or sound, or fatigue?"
    },
    {
      "turn": 2,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "No nausea. No sensitivity to light or sound. Feel tired, but not sick."
    },
    {
      "turn": 3,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Have you noticed anything that makes the headaches better or worse, like certain foods, stress, sleep patterns, or activities?"
    },
    {
      "turn": 3,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "Stress seems to make them worse. Screen time too. Coffee helps a bit. Sleep is poor."
    },
    {
      "turn": 4,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Do you have any other health conditions or take any medications regularly?"
    },
    {
      "turn": 4,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "No long-term conditions. Take paracetamol most days and ibuprofen occasionally. No regular prescribed medicines."
    },
    {
      "turn": 5,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Have you had any recent changes in your routine, such as work stress, lack of sleep, or changes in diet?"
    },
    {
      "turn": 5,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "Work stress. Long hours at the computer. Sleep is poor. Drink four coffees a day."
    },
    {
      "turn": 6,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Do you have any family history of headaches or migraines?"
    },
    {
      "turn": 6,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "My mother has migraines. No one else in the family has had migraines or brain problems."
    },
    {
      "turn": 7,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Thank you for sharing all that information. You’ve described frequent headaches that feel like a tight band around the head, worsened by stress and screen time, and improved slightly by coffee. You also mentioned poor sleep, work-related stress, and a family history of migraines from your mother.  \n\n[HISTORY COMPLETE]"
    }
